Depends: i2c-tools, fonts-dejavu-core
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Homepage: https://github.com/ifroncy01/easepi-oled-daemon
Description: SSD1306 OLED display daemon for EasePi-A2 (RK3568)
 Displays system status (IP, CPU usage, temperature and network speed) on a
 128x32 I2C OLED panel (SSD1306 on i2c-3, address 0x3C). The daemon switches
 automatically between 1-line, 2-line and 3-line layouts according to system
 load, and is managed by the oled.service systemd unit.
